OL,3,GNEWSA'I never enjoyed exercise at
OL,4,Aschool as I was bullied' says DJ, ahead
OL,5,Aof 400-mile bike feat
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Mentally, for me, it's been a
OL,8,Fchallenge," said Evans. "Hopefully I'm
OL,9,Fgoing to inspire people to do exercise
OL,10,Fand realise that you can do this; you
OL,11,Fdon't have to write off exercise
OL,12,Fforever."
